        "text_bLLBdR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Walk into a department store and a bottle you love can easily cost more than your weekly groceries. That always felt wrong to us. So we set out to build a shop where you can find the <strong>designer and niche fragrances</strong> people actually talk about, from houses like Creed, Parfums de Marly, Maison Francis Kurkdjian, Initio, Tom Ford and Xerjoff, at prices that make sense.</p><p>We buy at wholesale and keep our margins honest. There are no fancy counters, no celebrity campaigns and no markups hiding behind a pretty box. What you save goes straight back into your collection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "stats_nEMUQc": {
          "type": "stats",
          "settings": {
            "value_1": "4.8",
            "label_1": "Average rating from our customers",
